689C .done                      ; common exit of SoundRetrigNote
6902 .done                      ; common exit of SoundNoiPitchStep
69BF .done                      ; common exit of SoundNoiChordStep
6A26 .done                      ; common exit of Command_E_Pu1
6A5C .done2                     ; common exit of Command_E_Pu2
6A92 .done3                     ; common exit of Command_E_Noi
6B55 .done                      ; common exit of SoundLiveQueueStart
6B9A .done                      ; common exit of SoundSetPlayRange
